  "summary": "Evidence-bound decision-memory proposal, Human admission, conflict, retention, expiry and deletion contracts that emit non-persisted candidate capsules while provider indexes remain rebuildable projections. The runtime under runtime/ makes an admitted proposal a reducer-written ledger event, puts memory below source, test, ADR and receipt on the authority ladder, and deletes content without deleting history. providers/mem0 adds a rebuildable index over those events that is never canonical, never a writeback channel, and whose managed and self-hosted receipts cannot be read as evidence about each other."
